# Per-machine state an assistant CLI keeps for this project. The one that was tracked
# here was a symlink into a home directory, so it reached the server as a dangling link
# and then the image. The `*ignore` files and the `*.md` instructions beside them are
# real project configuration and stay versioned; this is not.
.antigravitycli/

# Copies the download targets leave behind before overwriting, named with `BACKUP_SUFFIX`
# in the Makefile. `download-media` alone drops 45 MB in the working tree, which is exactly
# the kind of thing `git add -A` sweeps in.
*.backup.*
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Project specific
# External channel-link data sources (see AGENTS.md): never commit them
screenshot*.png
*.m3u
# Input for addlinksource: external data, never part of the repository.
newera.txt
elcano.txt
soccertime_data_cache.sqlite
media
db
/static/
